::SCORE::
** 七字調（交響樂版）**
!= 100
?= E,
~ "origin: https://twoperapf.org.tw/resource/sheet-music/202"
~ "arranger: Symphonic orchestration based on 202.tmd"
<2/4>

/*
  Orchestra (15 melodic parts + percussion):
    Woodwinds : Flute, Oboe, Clarinet, Bassoon
    Brass     : Horn, Trumpet, Trombone, Tuba
    Percussion: Timpani, Drums (bass drum / crash cymbal)
    Harp
    Strings   : Violin1, Violin2, Viola, Cello, Contrabass

  Voice mapping:
    Vocal1 (A1, B1, C1)  -> Cello solo, then Cello + Horn
    Vocal2 (D1, E1, F1)  -> Violins (8va + loco), climax adds Flute/Oboe/Trumpet
    Piano interludes     -> woodwind solos; C2 and Outro are tutti
*/

